#HELP_BEGIN
Module retrieves custom property values from Fusion room
Advised not to trigger more than once per hour. 

Inputs
Request$: pulse to retrieve the Fusion room configuration

RoomConfigResponse$: Connects to the RoomConfigResponse$ signal on the Fuson Room Data device extender of the Fusion room


Outputs
RoomConfigRequest$: Connects to the RoomConfigQuery$ signal on the Fuson Room Data device extender of the Fusion room
 
CustomPropertyValues$[x]: Outputs the value of the Custom Property ID configured in the corresponding CustomPropertyIDs[x] parameter
         

Parameters
EnableNotFoundFB: When set to True, the CustomPropertyValues$[x] outputs will output a NOT FOUND - "custompropertyID" string
When set to false, the CustomPropertyValues$[x] outputs will output an empty string ("")

CustomPropertyIDs[x]: Here the desired custom property ID's should be entered. This is case sensitive
#HELP_END


